      "url": "https://careers.sapiens.com/content/north-america/?locale=en_US",
      "description": "Sapiens North America Sapiens North America Skip to main content Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Explore Life at Sapiens North America Sapiens Community Sapiens North America Here at Sapiens, we take pride in our commitment to innovation, collaboration, and employee growth. With a team of people across 30+ countries, Sapiens offers a dynamic environment where you can thrive, make an impact, and grow alongside some of the brightest minds in the insurtech industry. This page offers an inside look at life at Sapiens North America from insights into our local teams, to the distinct benefits of being part of our global community. About Sapiens North America Sapiens has been operating in North America since 1992. Sapiens North America has grown through both organic and inorganic channels, acquiring other insurance technology companies like Adaptik and Stone River to elevate our product offerings and competitive position. Today, Sapiens North America spans across the United States and Canada and is home to more than 650 people across multiple time zones. With our regional headquarters based in Rochelle Park, New Jersey, along with centralized hubs in various locations, Sapiens North America works in a remote-first environment with the option to work at a local hub if preferred. Our talented team in North America consists of professionals from diverse backgrounds, contributing their expertise in areas such as insurance, data & analytics, sales & marketing, and information technology & professional services. Join Us Your Recruitment Journey in North America We hope your recruitment journey with us is enjoyable and engaging, reflecting our commitment to your career aspirations and long-term success at Sapiens. With global collaboration at our core, our remote interview process connects you with diverse team members from around the world, offering meaningful insights into our culture and what it’s like to work at Sapiens North America. Here’s what you can expect: Send Your Application Take the first step by submitting your application. We’re looking for passionate individuals ready to grow and make an impact in the insurtech space. 1 Let’s Get to Know You Our North America talent team will carefully review your profile to understand how your experience aligns with our business needs and culture. 2 Meet the Team You’ll engage in virtual interviews with team members across regions, participate in presentations to showcase your strengths, and may be invited to complete technical assessments. This is your opportunity to shine and get a real feel for our collaborative, global environment. 3 Your Offer Awaits If there’s a match, we’ll extend an offer and walk you through the next steps. We’re committed to clear, timely communication throughout the process. 4 Welcome Onboard Once you accept, we’ll welcome you with a structured onboarding experience that connects you with your team, tools, and the broader Sapiens community across North America and beyond. 5 Get to Know Our Talent Acquisition Team Our dedicated recruitment team in North America is here to guide you through each step and provide any necessary support. We're committed to ensuring a smooth and transparent experience for all applicants. Daniel Pineda Talent Acquisition Leader Benefits of Joining the Sapiens North America Community In addition to offering local country specific benefits, our North America team also enjoys the following local perks: Comprehensive Health Insurance Coverage We believe that our employees should have access to healthcare coverage that promotes preventive care and helps cover the cost of illness. We offer a comprehensive healthcare coverage for all eligible employees. Flexibility & Work From Home We believe in balance. Enjoy paid time off, holidays, and a flexible work-from-home model that supports your lifestyle and well-being. Employee Support Services Your well-being matters. Our confidential Employee Assistance Program is here for you and your family - offering support whenever you need it. Recognition & Celebrations We love to celebrate you! we mark milestones with thoughtful gifts and heartfelt acknowledgments. Wellness & Engagement Activities Take time to recharge. Join us for yoga, meditation, wellness weeks, and seasonal gatherings - both virtual and in-person. Community & Culture Be part of a vibrant, inclusive culture. Connect through team games, seasonal events, and shared interests - from cooking classes to sports-themed challenges. Learning & Development Grow with us. Through Sapiens University and other professional development programs, we support your journey every step of the way. We look forward to welcoming you to the Sapiens North America community We are committed to fostering an environment where our employees can grow both professionally and personally. By joining us, you will belong to a culture focused on nurturing your potential, empowering you to achieve success and fulfillment in every step of your journey with us. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to our recruitment team. Let's start our journey together ! Corporate Sapiens Global Community FAQs My Profile career@sapiens.com Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Legal Notice Privacy Policy Candidate Privacy Policy © 2025 Copyright Sapiens International. All Rights Reserved.",
