      "url": "https://careers.sapiens.com/content/lithuania/?locale=en_US",
      "description": "Sapiens Lithuania Sapiens Lithuania Skip to main content Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Explore Life at Sapiens Lithuania Sapiens Community Sapiens Lithuania At Sapiens, we take pride in our global reach, with teams spanning 30+ countries worldwide. As an employer, we're committed to providing a rewarding and enriching experience for all our people around the world. This page is your gateway to learning more about life at Sapiens Lithuania from insights into our local team, to the unique benefits of joining our community. About Sapiens Lithuania Sapiens Lithuania has been part of Sapiens since 2021, following the acquisition of Tia Technology, a provider of flexible insurance software since 1997. Located in Vilnius, our office hosts a skilled team of around 150 employees from diverse backgrounds, contributing their expertise in areas such as software development, delivery, and software implementation. The team specializes in Sapiens TIA Enterprise and IDITSuite solutions within the Property & Casualty division, delivering innovative insurtech solutions globally. Join Us Sapiens Lithuania Initiatives Internship Program We are committed to nurturing talent and offer internship programs designed to help university graduates launch their careers in IT. As technical consultants, developers and testers, interns gain hands-on experience in software development, testing, requirements gathering, and consulting, setting a strong foundation for their future in the insurtech industry. Community & Culture At Sapiens Lithuania, culture is shaped by the employees themselves, who come together through various activity committees. Our Active Committee is made up of sports enthusiasts who participate in marathons, cycling adventures, and hikes, exploring the landscapes of Lithuania. Meanwhile, the Engagement Committee is driven by a group of creative volunteers who plan and organize company gatherings and a wide range of fun activities, bringing our teams closer together. Your Recruitment Journey in Lithuania We take great care to ensure that our recruitment process is transparent, efficient, and centered around you. With global collaboration at our core, we offer remote interviews and maintain clear, timely communication every step of the way. Here’s what you can expect: Send Your Application Take the first step in our journey by submitting an application that reflects your skills, experiences, and professional aspirations. 1 Let’s Get to Know You Your CV will be carefully reviewed by our talent team to explore how your unique skills and potential aligns with Sapiens’ business needs and culture. 2 Meet the Team This is your opportunity to shine! Meet with our team, showcase your abilities, and learn more about Sapiens. 3 Your Offer Awaits If there’s a match we’ll extend an offer to welcome you to our team. This is the exciting moment when your new journey begins to take shape. 4 Welcome Onboard Once you accept, we’ll guide you through a comprehensive onboarding process, introducing you to your new colleagues, roles, and the exciting challenges ahead. 5 Benefits of Joining the Sapiens Lithuania Community In addition to offering local country specific benefits, our Lithuania team also enjoys the following local perks: Training and Development Take advantage of our training platform, Sapiens University, dedicated to enhancing your skills and expertise, supporting your professional growth. Inclusive Work Environment Work in an inclusive environment with accessible facilities, where everyone is valued and respected. Private Health Insurance Benefit is active from the very first day, ensuring you are well taken care of. Life & Pensions Insurance Opportunity to receive employer contributions to your long-term pension savings. Bonus Schemes Employees are eligible for bonus programs designed to recognize performance, dedication, and impact. Healthy Snacks Every Day Enjoy healthy snacks at our office to keep you energized throughout the day. Friday Breakfast at The Office For more than 10 years we enjoy our Friday tradition of a sweet breakfast and get together with the team. Pet Friendly Office Welcome to bring your dog or cat to the office and share the joy with colleagues. Hybrid Working Model Hybrid work options may be available depending on role and business needs We look forward to welcoming you to the Sapiens Lithuania community We believe in creating an environment where our employees can thrive both professionally and personally. Join us and embark on a rewarding journey of growth and fulfillment. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to our recruitment team. Let's start our journey together ! Corporate Sapiens Global Community FAQs My Profile career@sapiens.com Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Legal Notice Privacy Policy Candidate Privacy Policy © 2025 Copyright Sapiens International. All Rights Reserved.",
