 many early recruits now holding senior roles. This program is vital to our ongoing growth, building essential knowledge within the company. Join Us Join Us Your Recruitment Journey in the UK We are committed to making your recruitment experience open, engaging, and tailored to your potential. We see the interview process as a two-way exchange, offering an open and transparent experience where you can get to know us just as much as we get to know you. Our process is designed to give you a clear view of what it’s like to work here while giving us the opportunity to understand your strengths, goals, and fit within our team. Send Your Application Share your CV and tell us about your experience, skills, and aspirations. We’re always looking for people who are curious, collaborative, and ready to grow. 1 Let’s Get to Know You Our recruitment team will reach out for a short screening call to learn more about you and your interest in the role. During this call, we’ll also cover our Background Screening policy (aligned with BS 7858) as required and audited by our UK customers. 2 Meet the Team You’ll take part in a series of in-depth interviews, including: A technical interview, a conversation with the hiring manager, and a final HR interview. For some specialized roles, you may also be asked to complete a technical task or deliver a short presentation giving you the chance to showcase your skills in action. 3 Your Offer Awaits If we’re a match, we’ll extend an offer and guide you through the next steps with clarity and care. 4 Welcome Onboard Once you accept, we’ll introduce you to your new team and provide a structured onboarding experience to help you feel confident and connected from day one. 5 Growth Stories We believe the best way to understand our culture is through the voices of our people. In these short videos, two of our team members share their personal growth stories. Their journeys reflect the opportunities, support, and career development that define life at Sapiens. Curious to hear more? Click here to watch: Get to Know Our Talent Acquisition Team Lisa Smith Talent Acquisition Team Lead, Europe Lisa Smith is the Talent Acquisition Lead for the UK, bringing a strong background in HR and recruitment. Since joining Sapiens in 2012, she’s grown into a leadership role, now guiding a team of TA professionals across Western Europe. Benefits of Joining the Sapiens UK Community In addition to the comprehensive global benefits offered by Sapiens, our UK team also enjoys the following local perks: Pension Permanent Health Insurance Private Healthcare Life Assurance Cycle To Work Scheme Holiday & milestone celebration gifts Training & development opportunities Inclusive working environment Global and local engagement events We look forward to welcoming you to the Sapiens UK community We believe in creating an environment where our employees can thrive both professionally and personally. Join us and embark on a rewarding journey of growth and fulfillment If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to our recruitment team. Let's start our journey together ! Corporate Sapiens Global Community FAQs My Profile career@sapiens.com Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Legal Notice Privacy Policy Candidate Privacy Policy © 2025 Copyright Sapiens International. All Rights Reserved.",
