      "url": "https://careers.sapiens.com/lp/Sapiens%20Community/c805ef18b6954472/",
      "description": "Sapiens Community Skip to main content Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Home Locations Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Jobs FAQs My Profile Join the Sapiens Community We're excited to have you here! This page covers our global community, the Sapiens experience, and recruitment process. Sapiens Community Discover Life at Sapiens Get an inside look at life at Sapiens, our vibrant culture, and tips on navigating our recruitment process. Follow us on social media to see firsthand what makes Sapiens special through stories and experiences from our global community. Follow us on: Why you will love being part of Sapiens Explore how our values align with your passion, growth and global impact: Be an Expert Be part of the insurance digitization revolution. Our people are recognized as experts all over the world. Become an expert yourself in a fast-growing company, with various development and personal growth paths. Express Yourself Bring your unique color to Sapiens. We have a deep culture of listening to our people. We always encourage them to speak up and make an impact. Growing Together Sapiens' consistent growth generates and enables an abundance of opportunities for our employees' professional and personal growth. Be Part of a Caring Community Caring is an important part of Sapiens' culture. We see all our employees for who they are. We care and appreciate each other. As a community, we love working together, and we support each other from every location and time zone. Go Global Work in a global team, get to see the world, and the beauty of inclusion. Enjoy the international vibe of working in an inclusive global team. Meet and work with interesting people from around the world. Join Us Your Recruitment Journey We will keep you in the loop, as we focus on providing an inclusive screening and interview process. Each country has a local flavor, but here's what you can expect during our recruitment process: Apply Take the first step in our journey by submitting an application that reflects your skills, experiences, and professional aspirations. 1 Review Your CV will be carefully reviewed by our talent team to explore how your unique skills and potential align with Sapiens' needs and culture 2 Interview This is your opportunity to shine! Meet with our team, showcase your abilities, and learn more about Sapiens 3 Offer If there's a great match, we'll extend an offer to welcome you to our team. This is the exciting moment when your new journey begins to take shape 4 Onboard Once you accept, we'll guide you through a comprehensive onboarding process, introducing you to your new colleagues, roles, and the exciting challenges ahead 5 About Working at Sapiens Sapiens is a leading software company in the insurtech market, offering innovative software solutions and services. We are proud of our extensive portfolio, recognized domain expertise, and cutting-edge technology used by over 600 insurers around the globe. Our diverse team of 6000 people spans 30+ countries, bringing a rich array of cultures, perspectives, and voices. Visit a few of our local sites to learn more: Israel India Poland North America Latvia Lithuania United Kingdom Explore Open Opportunities We're thrilled at the prospect of you joining us! See More Corporate Sapiens Global Community FAQs My Profile career@sapiens.com Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Opens in a new tab. Legal Notice Privacy Policy Candidate Privacy Policy © 2025 Copyright Sapiens International. All Rights Reserved.",
